{"p3_fr_sel": {"aspect": "16:9", "language": "fr", "plan": {"legit": true, "title": "Comment se forme le sel des marais salants", "description": "Découvrez comment l'eau de mer devient du sel dans les marais salants, grâce au soleil, au vent et au travail des sauniers. Un explicatif dessiné pas à pas.", "mood": "calm", "theme": "paper", "language": "fr", "voices": {"narrator": "Ambre"}, "beats": [{"id": "fa00a767", "narration": "Le sel que vous mettez dans vos plats vient parfois d'un simple bassin d'eau de mer. Comment la mer devient-elle du sel, sans aucune machine ? Grâce au soleil et au vent.", "scene": {"type": "whiteboard", "props": {"items": [{"id": "t1", "write": "Le sel marin", "tool": "marker", "ink": "blue", "zone": "top-row", "size": "l", "say": "mettez"}, {"id": "pot", "draw": "pot", "zone": "bottom-left", "size": "l", "say": "plats"}, {"id": "em0_pot", "mark": "circle", "on": "pot", "color": "red", "say": "simple"}, {"id": "sea", "draw": "sea_waves", "zone": "left", "size": "l", "say": "mer"}, {"id": "em1_sea", "mark": "circle", "on": "sea", "color": "blue", "say": "mer"}, {"id": "sunl", "write": "eau salée", "tool": "pen", "near": "sea", "side": "below", "size": "s", "say": "sans"}, {"id": "em2_sunl", "mark": "tick", "on": "sunl", "color": "red", "say": "machine"}, {"id": "sun", "draw": "sun", "zone": "right", "size": "l", "say": "soleil"}, {"id": "wind", "draw": "wind", "zone": "centre", "size": "l", "say": "vent"}]}}, "chapter": "De la mer au sel"}, {"id": "2e6b4c45", "narration": "L'eau entre par un canal, puis avance lentement de bassin en bassin. Elle est très peu profonde, donc le soleil la chauffe vite et l'eau s'évapore.", "scene": {"type": "whiteboard", "props": {"items": [{"id": "canal", "draw": "road", "zone": "bottom", "size": "l", "say": "canal"}, {"id": "bas", "write": "bassins", "tool": "pen", "near": "canal", "side": "below", "size": "s", "say": "bassin"}, {"id": "em0_canal", "mark": "circle", "on": "canal", "color": "red", "say": "elle"}, {"id": "drop", "draw": "water_drop", "zone": "bottom-right", "size": "l", "say": "profonde"}, {"id": "a1", "connect": "arrow", "from": "drop", "to": "canal", "color": "blue", "say": "chauffe"}, {"id": "m1", "mark": "underline", "on": "bas", "color": "red", "say": "vite"}, {"id": "m2", "mark": "circle", "on": "drop", "color": "orange", "say": "s'évapore"}], "board": "same"}}}, {"id": "c3931be0", "narration": "Quand l'eau s'évapore, le sel reste. Il devient de plus en plus concentré. Au bout d'un moment, l'eau ne peut plus le garder dissous, et il se met à cristalliser.", "scene": {"type": "whiteboard", "props": {"items": [{"id": "t2", "write": "Cristallisation", "tool": "marker", "ink": "blue", "zone": "top-row", "size": "l", "say": "reste"}, {"id": "em0_t2", "mark": "underline", "on": "t2", "color": "red", "say": "plus"}, {"id": "bk", "draw": "beaker", "zone": "left", "size": "l", "say": "concentré"}, {"id": "bkl", "write": "eau + sel", "tool": "pen", "near": "bk", "side": "below", "size": "s", "say": "moment"}, {"id": "em1_bkl", "mark": "circle", "on": "bkl", "color": "blue", "say": "plus"}, {"id": "em2_bk", "mark": "tick", "on": "bk", "color": "red", "say": "dissou"}, {"id": "sn", "draw": "snowflake", "zone": "centre", "size": "l", "say": "cristalliser"}, {"id": "a2", "connect": "arrow", "from": "bk", "to": "sn", "color": "blue"}]}}, "chapter": "Quand le sel apparaît"}, {"id": "92f95389", "narration": "La fleur de sel se forme en surface, fine et légère. Le gros sel tombe au fond du bassin. Les sauniers le rassemblent ensuite avec un long râteau.", "scene": {"type": "whiteboard", "props": {"items": [{"id": "fl", "write": "fleur de sel", "tool": "marker", "ink": "orange", "zone": "right", "size": "m", "say": "forme"}, {"id": "m3", "mark": "underline", "on": "fl", "color": "red", "say": "légère"}, {"id": "gs", "write": "gros sel", "tool": "marker", "ink": "black", "zone": "bottom", "size": "m", "say": "fond"}, {"id": "wk", "draw": "worker", "zone": "bottom-righ